OL,3,AUS judge blocks deportation of DoorDash
OL,4,Adriver shot by ICE
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Homeland Security
OL,7,F(DHS) has said it is investigating the
OL,8,Fshooting of an illegal migrant in the
OL,9,FTexan capital, but have not confirmed
OL,10,Fhe was shot in the back.
OL,12,FIt comes months after a US Immigration
OL,13,Fand Customs Enforcement (ICE) officer
OL,14,Ffatally shot a man in Houston.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
